---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import BusinessPerspectiveNote from '../../components/BusinessPerspectiveNote.astro';
import DegreePathwayPlanner from '../../components/DegreePathwayPlanner.astro';
const title = 'Degree Career Project Planner | BA, Botany, Forensic Science and BCA';
const description = 'Turn a degree interest into a small project: compare work signals, role families, route checks and evidence for BA Political Science, Botany, forensic science and BCA.';
const canonical = 'https://futurecareerschool.com/tools/degree-career-project-planner/';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Nav /><BusinessPerspectiveNote /><main class="dpp-page"><div class="dpp-shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/career-skills-compass/">Career &amp; Skills Compass</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">Degree career project planner</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">DECISION WORKSHEET · TEST THE WORK, NOT JUST THE TITLE</p><h1>What can this degree interest become in practice?</h1>
    <p class="lead">A degree can open several directions, but a title alone cannot tell you whether you will enjoy the work. Choose a subject family, make one small piece of evidence and use the route checks before committing time or money.</p>
    <DegreePathwayPlanner />
    <section class="notes"><h2>Use the result responsibly</h2><p>The planner is an editorial exploration aid. Confirm current admission rules, regulated-role requirements and course quality with the relevant official or institution source.</p><p><a href="/blog/career-options/career-chart-after-12th/">Compare after-12th routes</a> · <a href="/tools/career-route-finder/">Search the wider career catalogue</a> · <a href="/data-policy/">Read the data policy</a></p></section>
  </div></main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .dpp-page{min-height:70vh;padding:4rem 1.2rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%,rgba(109,213,237,.12),transparent 35%),#080c18}.dpp-shell{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto}.breadcrumb{display:flex;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.breadcrumb a,.notes a{color:#8de4d8;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}.eyebrow{color:#e5b84a;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.dpp-page h1{max-width:900px;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);margin:.65rem 0 1rem;color:#fff;line-height:1.05}.lead{max-width:850px;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,.76)}.notes{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);line-height:1.7}.notes h2{color:#fff}
</style>
